Subject: [PATCH 7/7] decklink: snapshot the frame last sent to the card
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Settings ▸ Playback can save the UYVY buffer last pushed to the DeckLink
card, after the gamma LUT, as raw .uyvy, a .json sidecar and a full-range
RGB PNG. The control-bridge command is transmit.snapshot (optional path).
Default folder: ~/Pictures/filmcraft-decklink-snapshots
(playback.transmitSnapshotFolder). A missing snapshot folder is created;
files are written inside it, not as <folder>.uyvy beside it.
